; Animation module (FDDA item scenes, pickup, backpack, wear, ledge climb): the hud sections
; and the extra hand motion sets, merged on top of system.ltx by the engine (x_ray.cpp) through
; the same overlay path the 3D PDA uses. No DA file is overridden. Scene sections carry only
; hands_position / item_visual / anm_* keys - nothing here is a spawnable object, so saves stay
; compatible with the original game.

